Package: jpeg-tools
Version: 1:3.0.1-r0.3
Description: Hardware accelerated JPEG compression/decompression library
 The jpeg-tools package includes client programs to access libjpeg
 functionality.  These tools allow for the compression, decompression,
 transformation and display of JPEG files and benchmarking of the libjpeg
 library.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OE-Core Developers <openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org>
License: IJG & BSD-3-Clause & Zlib
Architecture: aarch64
OE: libjpeg-turbo
Homepage: http://libjpeg-turbo.org/
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39+git5+e8f5217097), libjpeg62 (>= 3.0.1), libturbojpeg0 (>= 3.0.1)
Source: libjpeg-turbo_3.0.1.bb
